stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> draft: Architect uploads file\n(status='current', released_to=[])

    draft --> released: Architect clicks "Release to…"\n(released_to ⊆ {pm, contractor, client})

    released --> superseded: New revision uploaded\nEXCLUDE constraint fires:\nold row.status='superseded',\nold row.superseded_by = new.id

    released --> withdrawn: Architect withdraws release\n(released_to set back to [])

    withdrawn --> released: re-release with corrections

    superseded --> [*]: history retained forever\nsigned URLs continue to work

    note right of released
        Storage path is immutable.
        Signed URL TTL = 5 min,
        regenerated on each download.
    end note

    note right of superseded
        EXCLUDE constraint guarantees
        at most ONE 'current' per
        (project, title, type).
    end note
